  PieceIndex: 1
  TotalPieces: 1
  ItemText: 'Experiment 2005, Date 25/07/3067


    They are all gone, all of them.
    They were never even real, just a collection of constructed memories. But why
    do I miss them so much. Why do I craze their presence so much. I need to be alone,
    any interection makes me miss them, all of them. The Jane Doe experiments are
    offically shut down. I should have never sold my research... '
